  "description": "There's the beautiful yet mysterious writer Da-In Jung, and the newly-hired, diehard fanatic Hyunsoo Lee becomes her editor! But there's little time for glee, for as the writer's deadline approaches, she keeps ghosting him... and there isn't much time left! Ms. Jung, “The Manuscript, Please!”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/give_me_script)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/METROPOLIS/dadajintianjiaogaolema/list?title_no=1878), [French](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_0000130), Russian, [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0CQ889919/)",
